# Let the session user set panel brightness.
#
# EmulationStation writes <backlight>/brightness directly as the session
# user (ApiSystem::setBrightness -> writeAllText), with no helper and no
# privilege escalation. The kernel creates that attribute root:root 0644,
# so every write silently fails and the brightness slider appears stuck.
#
# GROUP=/MODE= on the device do not cover sysfs attributes, so the mode is
# set on the attribute itself. The seat user is already in the video group
# (postmarketos-base puts it there), so group-write is enough and nothing
# needs to run as root at runtime.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="backlight", \
	RUN+="/bin/chgrp video /sys/class/backlight/%k/brightness", \
	RUN+="/bin/chmod 0664 /sys/class/backlight/%k/brightness"
